        "heading": "MIL-STD-2073 Desiccant Calculator",
        "intro": "<p>In Method 50 packaging containers are sealed with activated desiccant inside, and MIL-STD-2073-1E sets the minimum quantity by formula. Enter your enclosure and the dunnage details to see the computed minimum, the whole-unit quantity to specify, and the MIL-D-3464 bags that make it up.</p><p>For help with your specific project, <a href=\"https://www.roycopackaging.com/pages/contact\" title=\"https://www.roycopackaging.com/pages/contact\">reach out to our experts.</a></p>",
